# Xcode's per-user WINDOW state — which files were open, where the cursor was.
# Binary, rewritten constantly, and it conflicted on every single merge between
# the two work streams (twice on 2026-09-17 alone) while carrying nothing anyone
# would want to keep.
#
# Deliberately narrow: `xcuserdata/**/xcschemes/` is NOT ignored. Those hold the
# scheme list, and `d0948f5` exists because removing the app's build scheme broke
# it — this is the one Xcode user file worth tracking.
*.xcuserstate

# Testing
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

